{"id":"vod_sn_37746","vodId":"37746","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"蓝兰岛漂流记","name_cn":"蓝兰岛漂流记","date":"2007-01-01","year":"2007","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/354edb42ba80293edf5386e8c735647e.jpg"},"summary":"东方院行人（下野紘 配音）是一个不太擅长和女孩子打交道的害羞少年，在一次负气出走中，倒霉的行人竟然遇见了百年难得一见的超级暴风雨。顺着海浪，行人漂流到了一座叫做蓝岛的岛屿上，而这竟然是一个全部都是女孩子的圣地！从来没有见过男孩子的女孩们对行人的到来产生了莫大的兴趣，为了避免混乱发生，岛上的长老决定举行一个“夫婿捉鬼游戏大会”，对于行人来说，他要做的唯一事情即是拼命逃跑。　　在岛上，行人结识了傻萌的小铃（堀江由衣 配音），能干的铃音（千叶纱子 配音），巫女麻知（高桥美佳子 配音）以及一大帮善良有爱的朋友们，蓝岛快乐又惊险的生活开始了！","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:55:06","playable":true,"episodeCount":26,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/7ShgXtUcYC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/E7deiNZ2YN1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/CZFeVSVeZa1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/LDeYyGtdUF1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/WcpdFeQac31/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/Txpi20NgMa1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/bpC80a51X91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ZQpK32hq7Q1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/giyWtUSaDi1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/6amWJGTLPF1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/0nRryZWCh11/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/sBsftZZHNX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/DyvhjnTW8s1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/j4b9ZKaNbp1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https:/